worked_q.zh:
逐行运行下面的完整程序，最后打印哪四个数？指出两个实例、属性以及被重写的方法。

```python
class Counter:
    def __init__(self, start):
        self.value = start

    def add(self, amount):
        self.value = self.value + amount
        return self.value

class DoubleCounter(Counter):
    def add(self, amount):
        return super().add(2 * amount)

a = Counter(1)
b = DoubleCounter(1)
r = a.add(2)
s = b.add(2)
print(a.value, b.value, r, s)
```

